      "content": "It sounds incredibly draining to feel as automated as a machine, and that sense of monotony can feel overwhelming. Please know that what you are feeling is a very real response to routine and feeling unseen, not a permanent state of being. Sometimes, even small shifts in your daily structure, like finding a moment for something entirely non-work related, can create a tiny crack in that feeling of mechanical existence. Would you be open to talking about one tiny thing you might be able to change this week?",
